From: Package maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] configure: search the transient Linux configuration path
Source: downstream
Upstream: not submitted; needs agreement on the Linux transient path

ImageMagick already loads installed package data before administrator data.
Add the matching /run directory between those tiers so temporary machine
configuration can refine package defaults without writing to /etc.

--- a/MagickCore/configure.c
+++ b/MagickCore/configure.c
@@ -806,0 +807,4 @@
+#if defined(MAGICKCORE_POSIX_SUPPORT)
+  (void) AppendValueToLinkedList(paths,ConstantString("/run/"
+    MAGICKCORE_CONFIGURE_RELATIVE_PATH "/"));
+#endif
